enron:enron_finance.owl.ttl dcterms:license "MIT" ;
	dcterms:title "Enron finance data estate ontology" ;
	pav:version "0.1.0" ;
	a owl:Ontology ;
	rdfs:label "enron_finance" ;
	skos:definition "Conceptual model for Enron Corp's trading, logistics, settlement and accounting estate circa 1999-2001, as evidenced by the Enron spreadsheet and email corpora. Every class maps to external standards (FIBO, OMG Commons, W3C ORG/PROV, schema.org) so lake records can be joined to other finance knowledge graphs. Instance IRIs are minted under the `enroni:` namespace and never reused (see ontology/ID_POLICY.md)." .
